adually, and above +30% nearly nobody bitesNegative reviews now scale with markup too - the higher you pus","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T23:52:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010500014","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4417480-1842846814454353","game_id":"steam-4417480","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Fixes 004","summary":"VisualsAnti-aliasing is on - no more shimmering edges when you turn the cameraCamera motion is smooth instead of subtly stutteryNew main menu background and loading screenCustomersThe streets are no longer empty in the morning, and visitors are spread across the day: busy in the afternoon, calmer in the morning, quiet in the eveningFewer customers come in, but each one buys more - your daily earnings hold steady and the shop stops feeling like a train stationBaskets grow with your level and your","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T01:02:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814454353","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4417480-1842212951308754","game_id":"steam-4417480","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Fixes - 003","summary":"Patch Notes — Fixes #03CustomersCustomers no longer walk out of the shop carrying merchandise. Under certain conditions, items picked up from a shelf would leave with the visitor and disappear from your stockFixed an issue where a figure could end up in your collection and leave with the customer at the same timeFixed a bug that caused some customers to fail to pick up products and simply turn aroundCustomers no longer leave empty-handed while you are moving the checkout counter - they will wait","occurred_at":